  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34706001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "准备——开始！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……这里是四季如夏的温暖小岛，有碧蓝的海水、热烈的日光和清爽的海风。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "假期的每一天都举行着大家喜爱的挑战赛，游泳、攀岩，还有竞争更强大更美好的沙滩排球挑战赛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "我是「小恶魔玛莉」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "「天使穗香」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝&穗香",
          "text": "欢迎来到「维纳斯群岛」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "噢——大海啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "OK,录好了。\n最后狐狸喊话的部分要剪掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "真是薄情啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……但看这段素材，好像感觉不太对？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔，是有什么问题吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "只说感觉不对，别人怎么改进嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……不够突显「天使」和「小恶魔」的印象。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "噢，我知道了，就是想要「天使」那样美好的感觉吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "那……玛莉就得像「小恶魔」一样表现得坏坏的……这样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，就这样再录一条。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "啊！？岛主是说玛莉现在就像小恶魔吗？\n唔唔……现在岛主的表情才更像是小恶魔哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "若干时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "在这个美妙的假期，和大家一起在挑战赛中活跃吧……「天使穗香」会一直等着你哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "呵呵呵，和「小恶魔玛莉」一起来玩吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝&穗香",
          "text": "欢迎来到「维纳斯群岛」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "啾咪——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "效果很完美，辛苦了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "居然录了这么多遍，真是过分啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等下一起去吃甜品吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706026",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "好耶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "兴奋……兴奋……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……再稍微录一点纯风景的片段吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？她们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34706030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "看上去是在写生呢，要去邀请她们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-812",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "doaxvv",
