        }
      ],
      "title": "日光下的挑战·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34707001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "岛主，你怎么来了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我有一个请求，呃……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "拉斐尔她……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "嗯……从刚才开始她就画得很专注的样子。\n连岛主来了也没注意到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "诶？画上的是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "波涛汹涌，海面上还有巨大的阴影……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "喂喂，这还是写生吗？\n这边明明阳光明媚，风平浪静。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不对，不该是这样的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "怎么了？没事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "啊，岛主你们来了……\n不好意思，我又控制不住创作的冲动了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果感觉不舒服，就先休息吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不，我只是有点惊讶会看到那样的画面。\n明明画的不是人像……能力应该不会生效的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……这也会是对未来的某种预言吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "我不信，这片海域可是一直风调雨顺的。\n画上的怎么可能会成真呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不用担心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34707017",
              "text": "大家都在这里"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34707017",
              "text": "无论发生什么，我们都会一起克服"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34707016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "嗯，谢谢你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "是的，我们会一起守护这来之不易的和平生活。\n刚才……岛主好像说有什么请求？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "说起来有些难以启齿——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "所以……现在需要我把水泼到海伦的身上吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，是度假时重要的玩水桥段。\n请海伦被水泼到的时候用手挡着，身体朝后方躲一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "好的，感觉还挺有意思的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "喂，这已经完全是在摆拍了啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "那么，我开始了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哗啦——哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "……嗯，躲了，然后我也要「反击」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "呀！\n不好意思……水有点凉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不错，很不错。\n表情可以再投入一点，注意不要看镜头。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "真是不知道这些人在干什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "喂——岛主，我们也来了哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34707031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "既然是玩水，我们也可以一起加入吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-813",
      "sourceRefs": [
