      ],
      "title": "日光下的挑战·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34708001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "喂！真乃也可以下水了，别抱着那个笨重的相机了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜——不能让正在录像的相机进水啊！\n事情怎么变成了这样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "排球网已经搭好了哦，可以玩水上排球了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "偶尔像这样玩闹，也真不错呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "身体在水里漂浮的时候，就好像失去了重力一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "——为什么大家都来玩水了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这也不是挺好的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小雪人",
          "text": "噢——天气真好呢——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "喂，会说话的雪人是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "好吧，好像我也没说这话的资格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708011",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哗啦——哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……被泼到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "呵呵，天使是不会做这种事的哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "嗯，但也不会是小恶魔做的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "来猜一猜吧，刚才到底是天使还是小恶魔干的呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34708017",
              "text": "既然是这样——"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34708017",
              "text": "我全都要"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34708016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哗啦——哗啦——哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "啊……淋透了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……真是的，岛主坏心眼。\n玛莉要还击了哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哗啦——哗啦——哗啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708021",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "时间就这样迅速地流逝——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "虽然在水里玩了这么久，但泳装在阳光下很快就干了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "身上暖洋洋的，感觉很好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "唔哇！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一颗排球重重地落在穗香的脚边，深深地陷入沙子中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "桀桀桀桀，来和本王进行排球赛吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我想看看你们打排球的本事,没意见吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……作为「封面女孩」，玛莉是不会退缩的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯嗯，没错。\n我们接受你们的挑战。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34708030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "很好，就让你们感受一下，真正的恐怖吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-814",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
